idges so the birds can fly onwards  shade-grown coffee provides a habitat  for the birds more and more amateur  ornithologists are discovering  Colombia's bird life bird watchers are  an important source of income for  promise and ecotourism is helping  preserve the biodiversity of this  Colombian mountain range  you
 

